# Raye Proton used to be a small launcher shipped by raye-gaming in the
# same folder.
Breaks: raye-gaming (<< 1.0~rc4~)
Replaces: raye-gaming (<< 1.0~rc4~)
Description: Steam compatibility tool for Windows games, built by Raye
 Raye Proton is GE-Proton, built by Raye from its sources with
 GE-Proton's own build system: Valve's Proton with the newest Wine,
 DXVK, VKD3D-Proton, NVAPI, media playback fixes, per-game fixes
 (protonfixes) and NTSync when the kernel has it. Steam shows it as
 "Raye Proton" in a game's Properties > Compatibility; games that talk
 to Steam from inside the game work, as with Valve's Proton.
 .
 It is not affiliated with Valve or with the GE-Proton project.
